WEBVTT

00:07:58.891 --> 00:08:01.685
my grandfather, my mother --

00:08:01.685 --> 00:08:05.523
production on that book

00:08:05.564 --> 00:08:07.316
brought me closer to them.

00:08:18.118 --> 00:08:21.789
And the same now has happened

00:08:21.830 --> 00:08:24.208
with Eric

00:08:24.250 --> 00:08:25.376
via "Sunshine."